  hsa:timeOfDay <https://health-culture.org/sleep-advice/facet/timeOfDay/during-the-night> ;
  hsa:condition <https://health-culture.org/sleep-advice/facet/condition/sleep-apnea> ;
  skos:definition "If you struggle with mouth breathing, try nasal strips or practice breathing exercises during the day to strengthen nasal breathing habits before considering mouth tape."@en ;
  skos:editorialNote "Wiki rates evidence weak-to-limited and impact low in its classification tables, but well supported on the item page. Safety for people with blocked noses or possible sleep apnea not checked; the plain line is cautious on purpose. The wiki's novelty-vs-reach section calls mouth taping 'strong scientific support but low commonality', which contradicts its own scores."@en .

